cff-version: 1.2.0
title: 'NullPhys: A Lean 4 library for formally verified null models'
message: 'If you use this library, please cite it as below.'
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Matthew
    family-names: Loftus
repository-code: 'https://github.com/MattLoftus/nullphys'
abstract: >-
  NullPhys is a Lean 4 + Mathlib library that formalises the null models
  commonly invoked in empirical hypothesis tests across physics, astronomy,
  machine learning, and neuroscience. Each null carries a machine-checked
  proof that it preserves its stated statistical invariant.
keywords:
  - lean4
  - mathlib
  - formal-verification
  - null-models
  - permutation-tests
  - statistical-methodology
license: Apache-2.0
version: '0.1.0'
date-released: '2026-05-19'
